        "comments": "The assembly sRajMic1.hap2.1 is based on 33x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial genome was assembled using MitoHiFi. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. The order and orientation of the scaffolds on Chromosome X from 3.83 to 5.47 are uncertain. Many chromosome fusions look to have occurred on Raja microocellata genome based on alignments to Raja brachyura (GCA_963513955). Sex chromosome was assigned based on synteny to Raja brachyura (GCA_963513955).",
